        <div class="answer-card" id="answer1">
            <h3 class="h6">Answer 1 - Generic Swap Utility</h3>
            <pre><code>public static class Utility // Defines a utility class to hold reusable helper methods.
{
    public static void Swap&lt;T&gt;(ref T first, ref T second) // Declares generic method to swap values of any type T.
    {
        T temp = first; // Stores first value temporarily so it is not lost.
        first = second; // Moves second value into first variable.
        second = temp; // Places original first value into second variable.
    }
}</code></pre>
        </div>

